{"lemma":"πλήν","translit":"plēn","gloss":"but/however","abbott_smith_html":"<b>πλήν </b><BR /> <i>adv.</i>, [in LXX for רַק, בַּד, אַךְ, etc. ;] <BR />__1. introducing a clause (= ἀλλά, δέ; \"it is obvious that πλήν was the regular word in the vulgar language\": Bl., § 77, 13), <b>yet, howbeit, only</b>: <ref='Mat.11.22, 24; 18.7; 26.39, 64'>Mat.11:22, 24 18:7 26:39, 64</ref> (M, <i>Pr.</i>, 86), <ref='Luk.6.24, 35; 10.11, 14; 10.20; 11.41; 12.31; 13.33; 17.1; 18.8; 19.27; 22.21-22, 42'>Luk.6:24, 35 10:11, 14 10:20 11:41 12:31 13:33 17:1 18:8 19:27 22:21-22, 42</ref> (WH, mg. om.) <ref='Luk.23.28'>Luk.23:28</ref>, <ref='1Co.11.11'>1Co.11:11</ref>, <ref='Eph.5.33'>Eph.5:33</ref>, <ref='Php.3.16; 4.14'>Php.3:16 4:14</ref>, <ref='Rev.2.25'>Rev.2:25</ref>; π. ὅτι (Hdt., Plat., al.), except that, save that, <ref='Act.20.23'>Act.20:23</ref>, <ref='Php.1.18'>Php.1:18</ref>. <BR /> __2. As prep., with genitive, except, save (cl.) : <ref='Mrk.12.32'>Mrk.12:32</ref>, <ref='Jhn.8.10'>Jhn.8:10</ref>, <ref='Act.8.1; 15.28; 27.22'>Act.8:1 15:28 27:22</ref>.†<BR /> (AS)","abbott_smith_is_AS":true,"strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":" moreover (besides), i.e. albeit, save that, rather, yet","derivation":"from G4119 (πλείων);","kjv_def":"but (rather), except, nevertheless, notwithstanding, save, than"},"lxx_note":"[in LXX for רַק, בַּד, אַךְ, etc. ;]","count_sbl":31,"count_tr_only":1,"tbesg_key":"G4133","tbesg_other":{},"occurrences":[],"as_refs":{"Mat.11.22, 24; 18.7; 26.39, 64":["Mat.11.22","Mat.11.24","Mat.18.7","Mat.26.39","Mat.26.64"],"Luk.6.24, 35; 10.11, 14; 10.20; 11.41; 12.31; 13.33; 17.1; 18.8; 19.27; 22.21-22, 42":["Luk.6.24","Luk.6.35","Luk.10.11","Luk.10.14","Luk.10.20","Luk.11.41","Luk.12.31","Luk.13.33","Luk.17.1","Luk.18.8","Luk.19.27","Luk.22.21-22","Luk.22.42"],"Luk.23.28":["Luk.23.28"],"1Co.11.11":["1Co.11.11"],"Eph.5.33":["Eph.5.33"],"Php.3.16; 4.14":["Php.3.16","Php.4.14"],"Rev.2.25":["Rev.2.25"],"Act.20.23":["Act.20.23"],"Php.1.18":["Php.1.18"],"Mrk.12.32":["Mrk.12.